== coupled transmission lines

This one does not need a model compiler. Expands to a given number of dual
RLGC links, with the coils coupled together. A transient simulation computes
some cross talk.

$ gnucap couple_paramset.gc

Now plot cpl.out.

== more advanced stuff

with the model compiler, more advanced stuff will become fairly easy to do.
Keywords are "generate", "laplace", and "overloading".
